# CV Optimizer - Project Structure & Architecture

Full-stack AI-powered CV optimization SaaS: FastAPI backend + React/TypeScript frontend.

## Tech Stack
- **Backend**: FastAPI, SQLAlchemy ORM, SQLite/PostgreSQL, OpenAI integration
- **Frontend**: React 18, TypeScript, Material-UI, Zustand state management
- **AI**: OpenAI GPT-4o-mini for parsing and content generation
- **Auth**: Clerk with JWT tokens
- **Files**: PDF/DOCX extraction and processing

## Directory Structure

### Backend (`/backend/`)
- [main.py](mdc:backend/main.py) - Application entry point
- [src/api/](mdc:backend/src/api/) - API endpoints
- [src/models/](mdc:backend/src/models/) - Database models
- [src/services/](mdc:backend/src/services/) - Business logic layer
- [src/schemas/](mdc:backend/src/schemas/) - Pydantic validation schemas
- [src/middleware/](mdc:backend/src/middleware/) - Auth and request middleware
- [src/utils/](mdc:backend/src/utils/) - Utility functions
- [tests/](mdc:backend/tests/) - Test suite (MVP coverage targets)

### Frontend (`/frontend/`)
- [src/App.tsx](mdc:frontend/src/App.tsx) - Main application
- [src/components/](mdc:frontend/src/components/) - Reusable UI components
- [src/pages/](mdc:frontend/src/pages/) - Page components
- [src/stores/](mdc:frontend/src/stores/) - Zustand state stores
- [src/services/](mdc:frontend/src/services/) - API service layer
- [src/hooks/](mdc:frontend/src/hooks/) - Custom hooks
- [src/contexts/](mdc:frontend/src/contexts/) - React contexts
- [src/types/](mdc:frontend/src/types/) - TypeScript types
- [src/utils/](mdc:frontend/src/utils/) - Utilities

## Architecture Layers

### Backend
- **API Layer**: FastAPI routers with dependency injection
- **Service Layer**: Business logic separated from endpoints
- **Model Layer**: SQLAlchemy ORM with relationships
- **Middleware**: Auth, CORS, request processing
- **Background Tasks**: ThreadPoolExecutor for AI processing

### Frontend
- **Components**: Reusable, composable React components
- **State**: Zustand stores for global state
- **Services**: Axios-based API with error handling
- **Hooks**: Reusable logic and side effects
- **Types**: Comprehensive TypeScript interfaces

## Core Features
- CV upload & AI parsing (PDF/DOCX)
- Job description integration (URL/manual)
- AI-enhanced content generation
- Real-time preview with drag-and-drop
- Clerk authentication
- Secure file management

## Database Models
- **Users**: Auth and user management
- **CVs**: File storage and parsed data
- **Job Descriptions**: Job requirements
- **AI Sections**: Generated content
- **CV History**: Version tracking
- **AI Usage Logs**: Usage analytics
